            subtitle: "분단의 경계, DMZ를 걷다",
            korean: `<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="the demilitarized zone" data-pronunciation="비무장지대는 [bimujangjiдaeneun]">비무장지대는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="not merely a border" data-pronunciation="단순한 경계일뿐더러 [dansunhan gyeonggyeilppundeoreo]">단순한 경계일뿐더러</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="a symbol of the tragedy of division" data-pronunciation="분단 비극의 상징이거니와 [bundan bigeukui sangjingigеoniwa]">분단 비극의 상징이거니와</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="hope for reunification" data-pronunciation="통일의 희망도 [tongiрui huimangdo]">통일의 희망도</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="is contained" data-pronunciation="품고 있는 바입니다 [pumgo inneun baimnida]">품고 있는 바입니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="walking along DMZ trails" data-pronunciation="DMZ 탐방로를 걷노라면 [DMZ tambangrorеul geonnoraмyeon]">DMZ 탐방로를 걷노라면</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="nature has recovered" data-pronunciation="자연이 회복된 모습에 [jayeoni hoebokdoen moseube]">자연이 회복된 모습에</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="one is amazed" data-pronunciation="놀라게 되거니와 [nollage doegеoniwa]">놀라게 되거니와</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="at the same time" data-pronunciation="동시에 [dongsie]">동시에</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="the pain of division" data-pronunciation="분단의 아픔도 [bundanui apeumdo]">분단의 아픔도</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="is keenly felt" data-pronunciation="절절히 느껴집니다 [jeoljeolhi neukkyеojipnida]">절절히 느껴집니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="if one thinks about the future of the peninsula" data-pronunciation="한반도의 미래를 생각할진대 [hanbandoui miraereul saenggakhalchindae]">한반도의 미래를 생각할진대</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="this place" data-pronunciation="이곳이야말로 [igosiyamallo]">이곳이야말로</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="will become the starting point of peace" data-pronunciation="평화의 시발점이 될 바입니다 [pyeonghwaui sibaljeomi doel baimnida]">평화의 시발점이 될 바입니다</span>.</p>
<p><span class="korean-word" data-translation="as long as division continues" data-pronunciation="분단이 지속되는 한 [bundani jisokdoeneun han]">분단이 지속되는 한</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="this place" data-pronunciation="이곳은 [igoseun]">이곳은</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="a reminder" data-pronunciation="경각심을 일깨우는 [gyeonggaksimeul ilkkaeuneun]">경각심을 일깨우는</span> <span class="korean-word" data-translation="remains" data-pronunciation="장소로 남을 바입니다 [jangsoro nameul baimnida]">장소로 남을 바입니다</span>.</p>`,
            translation: "The demilitarized zone is not merely a border but also a symbol of the tragedy of division, containing hope for reunification. Walking along DMZ trails, one is amazed by the recovered nature while at the same time keenly feeling the pain of division. Thinking about the future of the peninsula, one realizes this place will become the starting point of peace. As long as division continues, this place will remain a reminder.",
